{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 03 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">状态空间与 Mamba：长程传播、扫描偏置和 3D 代价</span><span class=\"lang-en\">State Space &amp; Mamba</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_017_vmamba-title\">VMamba</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">SS2D 将二维网格沿四个方向 selective scan 后再逆映射融合。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">2D Selective Scan (SS2D) unfolds spatial feature maps along four directional traversal paths, applies selective SSMs, and merges them back.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">2D 图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D image tensor</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">层级视觉特征或分类 logits</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Four-stage hierarchical visual feature maps or classification logits</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3(a) · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2024/hash/baa2da9ae4bfed26520bb61d259a3653-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_017_vmamba')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_017_vmamba')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"VMamba original paper architecture figure, Figure 3(a)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/e9a3f3a74054515fc69f.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3(a) · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_017_vmamba', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_017_vmamba\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_017_vmamba')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_017_vmamba', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_017_vmamba\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">图像先经卷积式 patch embedding 形成二维 token 网格。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image tensor and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"图像先经卷积式 patch embedding 形成二维 token 网格。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d image tensor and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_017_vmamba', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像先经卷积式 patch embedding 形成二维 token 网格。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image tensor and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"保持 H×W 拓扑并映射到 VSS 通道。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Patch Embed to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Patch Embed\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch Embed\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_017_vmamba', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Patch Embed</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">保持 H×W 拓扑并映射到 VSS 通道。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Patch Embed to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"生成横向正反与纵向正反四条扫描序列。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs unrolled within the core hierarchical 2d cross scan ssm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"四向展开\" data-node-name-en=\"unrolled\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_017_vmamba', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">四向展开</span><span class=\"lang-en\">unrolled</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">生成横向正反与纵向正反四条扫描序列。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs unrolled within the core hierarchical 2d cross scan ssm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每条方向执行 selective scan，传播长程二维上下文。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SS2D within the core hierarchical 2d cross scan ssm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"SS2D\" data-node-name-en=\"SS2D\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_017_vmamba', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>SS2D</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每条方向执行 selective scan，传播长程二维上下文。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SS2D within the core hierarchical 2d cross scan ssm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把四向输出逆排列并融合回原二维坐标。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Cross-scan Merge within the core hierarchical 2d cross scan ssm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Cross-scan Merge\" data-node-name-en=\"Cross-scan Merge\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_017_vmamba', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Cross-scan Merge</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把四向输出逆排列并融合回原二维坐标。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Cross-scan Merge within the core hierarchical 2d cross scan ssm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"SS2D、归一化、门控/MLP 与 residual 构成视觉状态块。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs VSS Block within the core hierarchical 2d cross scan ssm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"VSS Block\" data-node-name-en=\"VSS Block\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_017_vmamba', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>VSS Block</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">SS2D、归一化、门控/MLP 与 residual 构成视觉状态块。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs VSS Block within the core hierarchical 2d cross scan ssm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐级降低分辨率，形成类似 Swin 的层级金字塔。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Patch Merging within the core hierarchical 2d cross scan ssm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Patch Merging\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch Merging\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_017_vmamba', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Patch Merging</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐级降低分辨率，形成类似 Swin 的层级金字塔。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Patch Merging within the core hierarchical 2d cross scan ssm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在四个尺度重复 cross-scan 并扩大语义范围。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies VSS to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"多级 VSS\" data-node-name-en=\"VSS\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_017_vmamba', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多级 VSS</span><span class=\"lang-en\">VSS</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在四个尺度重复 cross-scan 并扩大语义范围。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies VSS to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"全局池化分类，或导出各级特征给 dense decoder。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces four-stage hierarchical visual feature maps or classification logits via Task Head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"任务头\" data-node-name-en=\"Task Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_017_vmamba', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Task Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">全局池化分类，或导出各级特征给 dense decoder。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces four-stage hierarchical visual feature maps or classification logits via Task Head.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"VMamba Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · VMamba 四方向二维交叉扫描</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · VMamba Four-Way 2D Cross-Scan &amp; Merge (SS2D)</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"VMamba：核心公式 · VMamba 四方向二维交叉扫描\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"17\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.178856pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.765054 -69.00913 306.049041 11.178856\" width=\"306.049041pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M6.970228-1.659233V-2.064984H1.231745L2.093967-3.108345L1.869354-3.347448L.449225-1.854863L1.869354-.376769L2.093967-.615873L1.231745-1.659233H6.970228Z\" id=\"m017_g7-32\"></path><path d=\"M6.970228-1.869354L5.550099-3.347448L5.325486-3