7_g10-185\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"136.516982\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g17-83\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"142.056208\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g17-99\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"146.479623\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g17-97\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"150.903037\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g17-110\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"155.957086\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g7-35\" y=\"-59.228668\"></use><use x=\"160.704979\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g13-45\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"167.574209\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g10-186\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"171.389885\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g13-150\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"175.650518\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g17-83\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"181.189744\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g17-83\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"186.728969\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g17-77\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"196.08389\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g10-185\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"199.79995\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g17-83\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"205.339176\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g17-99\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"209.76259\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g17-97\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"214.186005\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g17-110\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"219.240054\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g7-34\" y=\"-59.228668\"></use><use x=\"223.987947\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g13-45\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"230.857176\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g10-186\" y=\"-60.859302\"></use><use x=\"234.87211\" xlink:href=\"#m017_g4-1\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">将图像按单条 1D 序列展平会破坏二维拓扑</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Flattening a 2D image into a single 1D causal raster scan destroys 2D spatial proximity along non-scan directions.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以四方向 2D selective scan 和层级 VSS block 建模视觉结构</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Traverse 2D feature grids simultaneously along four complementary corner-to-corner paths before summing the selective scan outputs.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">SS2D cross-scan 与多尺度层级 backbone</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">SS2D four-way cross-scan module embedded within a hierarchical Visual State-Space (VSS) backbone.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">作为医学 2D SSM 的视觉初始化和对照；原生 3D 仍需改造扫描与层级结构</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Serves as the primary 2D vision SSM backbone and initialization for medical 2D segmentation and classification.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">重要视觉 SSM 基线；未普遍淘汰 ConvNeXt/Swin</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Important visual SSM baseline; native 3D volumetric extension requires tri-axial or multi-directional scan adaptations.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">四向 cross-scan 缓解单条 raster 序列对二维邻接关系的破坏。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">selective SSM 提供长程传播，patch merging 提供视觉多尺度。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">扫描顺序本身成为新的归纳偏置，线性阶仍乘以方向数。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Traverse 2D feature grids simultaneously along four complementary corner-to-corner paths before summing the selective scan outputs.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: SS2D four-way cross-scan module embedded within a hierarchical Visual State-Space (VSS) backbone.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: VMamba Four-Way 2D Cross-Scan &amp; Merge (SS2D).</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可作为医学 2D SSM backbone 或后续 3D 扩展的机制参考。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">迁移到体数据需要新增轴向/多方向扫描，不能把 2D 权重直接等同原生 3D 表示。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Serves as the primary 2D vision SSM backbone and initialization for medical 2D segmentation and classification.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Important visual SSM baseline; native 3D volumetric extension requires tri-axial or multi-directional scan adaptations.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2024/hash/baa2da9ae4bfed26520bb61d259a3653-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>VMamba: Visual State Space Model</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/MzeroMiko/VMamba\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
